                                                "sense_id": "925e3550-db8c-3481-9f90-119fe47b75cf",
                                                "text": "I love you from the bottom of my pencil case / I love the way you never ask me why"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7fffcbb1-5df5-4cff-890f-d73191dd0dea",
                        "source_entry_id": "62f35cac-6eed-3ef2-9d22-42a2e20b1bf5",
